Building the thesis
===================

Run these commands from the repository root.

    cd manuscript
    latexmk

Use TeX Live or MacTeX with latexmk 4.84 or later, pdfLaTeX, Biber, and
MakeIndex. The project configuration runs all the passes needed to resolve
references, contents, and page positions. Open build/main.pdf.
To rebuild from scratch, run `latexmk -gg` in the same directory.

ClassicThesis.pdf beside the source is the original style manual. The
archived thesis submission is in ../website/public/files/thesis.pdf.

